Breahiw
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 76 ROTATE 3 U 2
XIY 10 FACE_LAST
XIY 8 FACE_LAST
XIY 10 FACE_LAST
XIY 0 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE XIY XIY
AND
    OR
        DEST Size > 4
        DEST Rank 1
    AND
        DEST Suit {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS}
        DESTSRC Suit match_color
MOVE DRAW XIY
AND
    DEST Rank 1
    OR
        DESTSRC Rank add_14
        DEST Size < 3
MOVE_STACK XIY XIY
AND
    AND
        DEST Rank K
        SRCSTACK Rank add_13
    DEST Suit {HEARTS, CLUBS}
$win
AND
    AND
        PILE ALL XIY Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    PILE ALL XIY Empty
